//   4  tabs    the channel tabs visibly clickable, with the invitation, changing on their own with a bar until the first click; keyboard
//   5  typing  the typing dots stand ≥ 2 s, no mark on the phone tab, no state line
//   6  flow    four connected fields on one track that fills on scroll, the mark exactly centred, the four stations on one line
//   7  scenes  the pinned stage: every scene stands ≥ 1 s at a normal scrolling speed, no blocking transition, a click jumps
//   8  chapters Atiende · Organiza · Crece, Crece with its five scenes incl. the report
//   9  rail    one connected progress rail, no single circles
//   10 grounds soft grounds that feather, no hard white bars
//   11 3d      the steps by scroll (01 → 04 in order), the clip only when it can play, a click still jumps
//   12 path    "Tu camino" as one run; ES at 1440 px: the words on one line, the button on one line
//   13 luxury  no blue tiles, no glow, no uniform pills; the headline variant (?display=fraunces)
//   14 entry   the target state shows the trial and the three steps; the public view access by invitation, nothing else
//   15 compare the switch Sin / Con NuovaSolution on the home page and /example-report, calm, usable, no money promise
//   plus       fonts, words, EN, reduced motion, no JavaScript, the phone
